                 并以距视口右 --toc-edge-gap 为底线）；此处 #toc-wrapper 仅承载显隐与宽高 -->
            <div id="toc-wrapper" class:list={["block transition absolute top-0 w-[var(--toc-card-width)] items-center",
                {"toc-hide": siteConfig.wallpaperMode.defaultMode === "banner"}]}
